.augment/
.autohand/
.bob/
# Local Claude config stays out, except the skills authored for this repo. Those are project
# assets: xoot-authz-audit encodes the authorization audit method, xoot-content carries the
# claim rules that keep a blog post out of CPA s41 trouble. Losing them with the container
# would mean rediscovering both.
#
# Vendored third-party skills stay ignored -- they are installed, not authored here, and one of
# them ships several megabytes of audio. Re-including a path needs its parent re-included
# first, hence the directory-by-directory form rather than a single negation.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/xoot-authz-audit/
!.claude/skills/xoot-content/
!.claude/skills/xoot-supabase-ops/
!.claude/skills/evidence-before-claims/
